### =====================================================
### TEST ADMIN LOGIN - BCrypt Fixed
### =====================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5042/api/v1

### =====================================================
### 1. Login as Admin
### Email: admin@flightbooking.vn
### Password: Admin@123456
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/Users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@flightbooking.vn",
  "password": "Admin@123456"
}

### =====================================================
### 2. Register New User (for testing)
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/Users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test@123456",
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "phone": "0987654321"
}

### =====================================================
### 3. Login as Test User
### =====================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/Users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test@123456"
}

### =====================================================
### NOTES:
### - Admin account được tạo qua script: create_admin_account.ps1
### - Password được hash bằng BCrypt tự động khi register
### - Login trả về JWT token để dùng cho các API khác
### =====================================================
